# Payload lab vehicle (sysid 31): servo mount + still camera for mavlink-payload SITL.
# Measured on Copter-4.7.0 with --gimbal (sitl/measure-payload-gimbal.js / DESIGN.md §14):
#   DO_MOUNT_CONTROL / DO_MOUNT_CONFIGURE / ROI → ACCEPTED
#   IMAGE_START_CAPTURE → ACCEPTED with CAM1_TYPE 1
#   VIDEO_START/STOP_CAPTURE → DENIED (servo camera has no video path)
#   GIMBAL_MANAGER_SET_PITCHYAW → send-only; no manager telemetry on this stack

# Servo gimbal (docs + --gimbal): pan / roll / tilt functions
MNT1_TYPE 1
SERVO6_FUNCTION 6
SERVO7_FUNCTION 8
SERVO8_FUNCTION 7

# Still camera on a spare servo (CAM1_TYPE 1 = Servo)
CAM1_TYPE 1
CAM1_SERVO_ON 1300
CAM1_SERVO_OFF 1100
SERVO9_FUNCTION 10
